,"description":"DO NOT USE. Use \":Distributed/Indices APIs\" or \":StorageEngine/Templates\" instead."},{"id":1967496097,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTY3NDk2MDk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/labels/Team:Data%20Management%20(obsolete)","name":"Team:Data Management (obsolete)","color":"fef2c0","default":false,"description":"DO NOT USE. This team no longer exists."}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2024-12-04T19:04:28Z","updated_at":"2024-12-12T22:14:58Z","closed_at":"2024-12-12T22:14:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Elasticsearch Version\n\n8.18\n\n### Installed Plugins\n\n_No response_\n\n### Java Version\n\n_bundled_\n\n### OS Version\n\nLinux\n\n### Problem Description\n\nThe `GET _migration/deprecations` API in 8.18 no longer lists deprecations for hidden indices like `.ml-*` by default:\n- if you run `GET _migration/deprecations` the deprecation warnings are not displayed\n- if you run GET `.ml*/_migration/deprecations` they are displayed\n\nThis is a change from the previous behavior in 7.17, where `GET _migration/deprecations` would list the deprecation for `.ml*` indices in the `index_settings` part and the deprecation for ML model snapshots in the `ml_settings` part.\n\nThis change in the API behavior breaks the expected workflow in Kibana Update Assistant in 8.18 since now no ES deprecation warnings for `.ml-*` indices are shown before the major upgrade.\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Set up a cluster in 7.17\n2. Create an anomaly detection job, e.g. using kibana flights data\n3. Upgrade the cluster to 8.18\n4. Run `GET _migration/deprecations` in Dev Console\n\n### Logs (if relevant)\n\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"elasticsearchmachine","id":58790826,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NzkwODI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58790826?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine","html_url":"https://github.com/elasticsearchmachine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elasticsearchmachine/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/118020/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/118020/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}